ttps://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-02-24T02:31:50Z","updated_at":"2026-05-19T16:22:56Z","closed_at":"2026-05-19T16:22:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.6.1 stable\n- Not reproducible in v4.5.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 3GB (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8115) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-6700 CPU @ 3.40GHz (8 threads) - 31.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/848cb9b5-dbc0-4878-8a0d-8c303f9666c3\n\nAs shown in the video, changing the properties of a MeshInstance3D's Mesh is fine at first, but as soon as I create an unsaved scene, the inspector starts jittering up and down every time I change a different property.\nIf you look closely, you can see that this is the specific part of the inspector that's causing the jitter:\n<img width=\"401\" height=\"54\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a23e0cd-c79b-42e5-a503-9f357fb9b068\" />\n\nSaving or closing the unsaved scene returns things back to normal.\nLet me know if I'm leaving out any relevant information. I've never reported a bug before.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a 3D scene, but do not save it\n2. Add a MeshInstance3D with a box Mesh.\n3. Change different properties of the box mesh. The jitter will stop happening if you keep changing just one property instead of changing different properties.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116703/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116703/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}